  "name": "FOCI Discrete Sample Database",
  "description": "Station location and sampling information from FOCI biological cruises.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Multiple tasks: to create a record of cruise activity; to link related sampling via location, sampling gear, or sample type; calculate at-sea maps of data collection locations and standard catch information; track sample collection, shipping, and processing.",
